# Pause-orphan test (drop-in), 4 seats: NHL94_SEATS=home:C,home:RD,away:C,away:G
# (menu: Head to Head, 30-second periods). PLAYER n = seat n-1 = game pad n.
# All four seats push at once: seat0 UP, seat1 RIGHT, seat2 UP, seat3 LEFT,
# Menus -> on ice (as lock4.input), then seat 0 (pad 1) pauses; the test knob
# GENESIS_SIM_TEST_ABSENT=0@<tick> drops seat 0 while the pause menu is up.
# Expect: "pause menu orphaned" after ~300 frames and play resumes (the clock
# moves again). Run: tools/seats/drop_checks.sh
WAIT 600
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS DOWN 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
WRITE_RAM16 0xFFD050 0x0003
PRESS START 5
WAIT 600
PLAYER 1
PRESS START 5
WAIT 900
